    "detailed_description": "Have you ever dreamed of having your own museum where you can collect monsters?<br />\r\nDream no further, because now you can do it in Monster Museum!<br />\r\nIn this world, you can summon and collect monsters inspired by mythologies around the world and display them at your very own museum.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n- Manage your own museum<br />\r\n- More than 50 monsters to collect and discover<br />\r\n- Buy decorations and make your museum the best to fit your style<br />\r\n- Tons of minigames! Such as fishing, planting, treasure hunting and many more<br />\r\n- Combine monsters to increase its tier and power<br />\r\n- Explore the city and find all the secrets!<br />\r\n- Follow the exciting story about the city<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAnd most importantly, make your monster museum the best in the world!",
